EphemeralFactory_GetAddress
├── when given a typed intent
│   └── it should predict the executor CREATE2 address
├── when given the canonical blob
│   └── it should match the typed prediction
└── when any parameter changes
    └── it should derive a different address

EphemeralFactory_ExecutorCode
└── it should return the executor creation code

EphemeralFactory_ExecuteIntent
├── when the intent executes
│   ├── it should deploy at the predicted address
│   ├── it should leave no code at the address
│   └── it should emit IntentPublished with the canonical blob
├── when the router reads the context
│   └── it should expose route, sweep, keeper and router
└── when executed twice with the same intent
    └── it should reuse the address
